[2026-05-31T16:14:41.055242] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Complete - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Complete Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'data_loader.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 7, 'end_line': 26, 'line_count': 20, 'lines_returned': 20, 'total_lines': 32, 'snippet': 'class DataLoader:\n    def load_csv(self, file_path):\n        """\n        Loads financial data from a CSV file.\n\n        Parameters:\n        file_path (str): Path to the CSV file.\n\n        Returns:\n        pd.DataFrame: Loaded financial data.\n        """\n        return pd.read_csv(file_path)\n\n    def load_api(self, endpoint):\n        """\n        Loads financial data from a given API endpoint.\n\n        Parameters:\n        endpoint (str): The API endpoint to fetch data from.\n\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 775, 'modified_ts': 1780236872.982099, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 766, 'arguments': {'path': 'data_loader.py', 'start_line': 7, 'line_count': 20}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.004853963851928711
