[2026-05-31T16:14:41.065468] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Complete - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Complete Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'visualization.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\n', 'start_line': 7, 'end_line': 36, 'line_count': 30, 'lines_returned': 30, 'total_lines': 37, 'snippet': 'class Visualization:\n    def plot_data(self, data):\n        """\n        Plots the financial data.\n\n        Parameters:\n        data (pd.DataFrame): Financial data to plot.\n        """\n        plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\n        plt.plot(data[\'date\'], data[\'close\'], label=\'Close Price\')\n        plt.title(\'Financial Data\')\n        plt.xlabel(\'Date\')\n        plt.ylabel(\'Price\')\n        plt.legend()\n        plt.show()\n\n    def plot_indicators(self, indicators):\n        """\n        Plots the calculated indicators on the financial data.\n\n        Parameters:\n        indicators (dict): Dictionary containing indicator names and their values.\n        """\n        plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\n        for name, values in indicators.items():\n            plt.plot(values, label=name)\n        plt.title(\'Indicators\')\n        plt.xlabel(\'Date\')\n        plt.ylabel(\'Value\')\n        plt.legend()\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 1028, 'modified_ts': 1780236872.985463, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1205, 'arguments': {'path': 'visualization.py', 'start_line': 7, 'line_count': 30}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0036296844482421875
