[2026-05-31T16:15:48.505565] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'financial_analyzer.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 1188, 'snippet': '    def calculate_moving_average(self, window: int) -> pd.Series:\r\r\n        """Calculates the moving average of the financial data."""\r\r\n        return self.data[\'Close\'].rolling(window=window).mean()\r\r\n\r\r\n    def calculate_rsi(self, period: int) -> pd.Series:\r\r\n        """Calculates the Relative Strength Index (RSI) of the financial data."""\r\r\n        delta = self.data[\'Close\'].diff()\r\r\n        gain = (delta.where(delta > 0, 0)).rolling(window=period).mean()\r\r\n        loss = (-delta.where(delta < 0, 0)).rolling(window=period).mean()\r\r\n        rs = gain / loss\r\r\n        return 100 - (100 / (1 + rs))\r\r\n\r\r\n    def calculate_macd(self) -> pd.Series:\r\r\n        """Calculates the MACD of the financial data."""\r\r\n        short_ema = self.data[\'Close\'].ewm(span=12, adjust=False).mean()\r\r\n        long_ema = self.data[\'Close\'].ewm(span=26, adjust=False).mean()\r\r\n        return short_ema - long_ema\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 4691, 'modified_ts': 1780236929.9100156, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1261, 'arguments': {'path': 'financial_analyzer.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.004601478576660156
