[2026-05-31T16:16:05.290529] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'financial_analyzer.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 1194, 'snippet': '1:    def calculate_moving_average(self, window: int) -> pd.Series:\r\n2:        if \'Close\' not in self.data.columns:\r\n3:            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\n4:        return self.data[\'Close\'].rolling(window=window).mean()\r\n5:        if \'Close\' not in self.data.columns:\r\n6:            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\n7:        delta = self.data[\'Close\'].diff()\r\n8:            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\n9:        if \'Close\' not in self.data.columns:\r\n10:            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\n11:        short_ema = self.data[\'Close\'].ewm(span=12, adjust=False).mean()\r\n12:\r\n13:\r\n14:\r\n15:    def calculate_rsi(self, period: int) -> pd.Series:\r\n16:\r\n17:        """Calculates the Relative Strength Index (RSI) of the financial data."""\r\n18:\r\n19:        delta = self.data[\'Close\'].diff()\r\n20:\r\n21:        gain = (delta.where(delta > 0, 0)).rolling(window=period).mean()\r\n22:\r\n23:        loss = (-delta.where(delta < 0, 0)).rolling(window=period).mean()\r\n24:\r\n25:        rs = gain / loss\r\n26:\r\n27:        return 100 - (100 / (1 + rs))\r\n28:\r\n29:\r\n30:\r\n31:    def calculate_macd(self) -> pd.Series:\r\n32:\r\n33:        """Calculates the MACD of the financial data."""\r\n34:\r\n35:        short_ema = self.data[\'Close\'].ewm(span=12, adjust=False).mean()\r\n36:\r\n37:        long_ema = self.data[\'Close\'].ewm(span=26, adjust=False).mean()\r\n38:\r\n39:        return short_ema - long_ema\r\n40:\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 5721, 'modified_ts': 1780236956.8861618, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1857, 'arguments': {'path': 'financial_analyzer.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40, 'inline_line_numbers': True}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.014174938201904297
