[2026-05-31T16:17:15.954299] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'financial_analyzer.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 2386, 'snippet': '    def calculate_moving_average(self, window: int) -> pd.Series:\r\r\n        if \'Close\' not in self.data.columns:\r\r\n            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\r\n        return self.data[\'Close\'].rolling(window=window).mean()\r\r\n            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\r\n        delta = self.data[\'Close\'].diff()\r\r\n            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\r\n        if \'Close\' not in self.data.columns:\r\r\n            raise ValueError("Missing \'Close\' column in data")\r\r\n        short_ema = self.data[\'Close\'].ewm(span=12, adjust=False).mean()\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n    def calculate_rsi(self, period: int) -> pd.Series:\r\r\n\r\r\n        """Calculates the Relative Strength Index (RSI) of the financial data."""\r\r\n\r\r\n        delta = self.data[\'Close\'].diff()\r\r\n\r\r\n        gain = (delta.where(delta > 0, 0)).rolling(window=period).mean()\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 6868, 'modified_ts': 1780236976.512514, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1245, 'arguments': {'path': 'financial_analyzer.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.0033416748046875
