0)).rolling(window=period).mean()\n    rs = gain / loss\n    return 100 - (100 / (1 + rs))\n```\n\nThese changes enhance the robustness and functionality of the software, ensuring better handling of financial data analysis. If you have further modifications or additional features you\'d like to implement, feel free to let me know!'}], 'metadata': {'source': 'Programmer Code Review'}}], 'context_trace_complete': True}}], 'node_type': 'literal', 'input_count': 1, 'predecessors': ['Code Complete All Phase Loop Counter', 'Programmer Code Review', 'Code Review Phase Loop Counter', 'Programmer Code Complete'], 'successors': ['Programmer Code Review', 'Code Reviewer']} 
